Package: singscore
Title: Rank-based gene-set scoring (minimal API for ALLCatchR2)
Version: 1.27.0
Authors@R: person("Foroutan", "et al.", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "local@local")
Description: Implements rankGenes() and simpleScore() from the published
    singscore method (Foroutan et al., BMC Bioinformatics 2018) so ALLCatchR2
    can run when Bioconductor/GitHub are unreachable. Scoring matches the
    official rank/(N+1) mean, centered by 0.5, TotalScore = Up - Down.
License: GPL-3
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
